{"summary":"A noir thriller where every puzzle reveals a darker truth.","description":"YOUR HOUSE - Read the Story. Solve the Puzzles. Uncover the Truth.\n\nChapter 1 is FREE. Unlock the full story via in-app purchase.\n\nA house holds secrets. You hold the key.\n\nYOUR HOUSE is a noir interactive thriller where every page hides a puzzle and every puzzle reveals a darker truth. Read, investigate, and solve your way through a chilling mystery of identity, ambition, and deception.\n\nOn her 18th birthday, Debbie's world collapses. Expelled. Betrayed. Then struck by a car. But at midnight, an envelope appears on her bed — a key, a postcard, an address. With nothing left to lose, she follows it into a massive, ominous house full of long-buried secrets.\n\nWhat You'll Experience\n- Puzzles woven seamlessly into the narrative\n- Hidden rooms and cryptic objects to investigate\n- A haunting noir comic-book aesthetic\n- Two intertwined stories across time\n- Inspired by a real Manhattan apartment and its secrets\n- A standalone prequel to the acclaimed UNMEMORY\n\nNot just a game. A story you solve.\n\nThe house remembers. Do you dare step inside?","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$5.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FpYjxvgKjGI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4wp_yulapsEUrsmTnKLrTAvmEWu7RKVh33GFqAarEoj2wBUngqyfkohCrhlbzkvbP7Gr01O06E8lSjMvFH7I","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0b_3x2-81zCalymzATKEllVTiifQRWFzEE8NY3JJryBBdUQUeB70yBBI5XdWPKy5R9EGGBtVXoNzuj7C8xZXpsA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PcSCKJ3mp5I1ypbEmL44fdke9GkUOtK3RvYbU4E0ntskHUpBTpDbhA-9dhe1arst4F9PVaAZ4cX_Ag4fbSdK","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nmNG6ZG2yJVl7BUfHi2-004BMM68r7TBN8LZ2oPlP3cK0nhoCskTy3FOBRaX-lYlJJEgzI4Cx7YXxbE1-Qatlrk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PPTxNw9N4pql8hUl9GdhHKrj7v2-Qdy4EDBjog7_2I5eX1GH4PuAfT96XqppDdP1CO67JdguG3Norbvm1AqVGg","https://play-lh.googleuserconte